			<item>
				<title>Kalender 1934 - Hannoverscher Anzeiger</title>
				<link>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/kalender-1934-hannoverscher-anzeiger/manifest.json</link>
				<pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2020 20:24:07 +0200</pubDate><author>mail@christianmahnke.de (Christian Mahnke)</author>
				<guid>https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/en/post/kalender-1934-hannoverscher-anzeiger/manifest.json</guid>
				<description>&lt;p&gt;The first entry is about the inspiration for some design elements. They are taken from the cover of the 1934 calendar of the Hannoverscher Anzeiger. A very beautiful depiction of the &lt;a href=&#34;https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/tags/Anzeiger-Hochhaus&#34;&gt;Anzeiger Hochhaus&lt;/a&gt; in &lt;a href=&#34;https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/tags/Hannover&#34;&gt;Hanover&lt;/a&gt; by &lt;a href=&#34;https://backsteinexpressionismus.projektemacher.org/tags/Fritz-H%c3%b6ger&#34;&gt;Fritz Höger&lt;/a&gt;. Unfortunately, apart from the advertisement at the end, this illustration is all there is on the subject in the calendar.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
